<title>CANADA: Canada court orders new trial in euthanasia case.</title>
<headline>Canada court orders new trial in euthanasia case.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Supreme Court ordered a new trial on Thursday of farmer Robert Latimer, who was convicted of murdering his handicapped daughter, but denied him the full acquittal he sought.</p>
<p>The high-profile case was decided on legal technicalities such as whether his confession was admissible, rather than the issue of whether euthanasia was acceptable.</p>
</text>
